# Normal maps (ABI 1.20) under a low morning sun, no fog. Three panels lie
# on the ground with the same 4 x 4 grid of domes in a tangent-space normal
# map, the tangent frame derived per pixel (no tangents in the mesh):
#  - left: scale 1, uvs as usual: each dome is lit on its sun side (+X,
#    towards the right of the frame) and dark on the far side.
#  - middle: scale 1 with the uvs mirrored in u, which a derived frame
#    handles: the domes still light on the sun side.
#  - right: scale 0, which flattens the map away: an even, flat panel.
# Behind them a box wears the map on its four sides (two domes across each),
# showing the frame follows each face; the panel's shadow falls behind it.
size 480 270
camera 0 7 8  0 0 -2  50 0.3 200
lighting sun 0.3 55  4 2048 40 0.6 0
clear 0.5 0.6 0.75 1
item cube 0 -0.5 0  40 1 40  0.5 0.5 0.5
texture domes bumps 128 128 4 4

mesh 0.8 0.75 0.7
vertices -6.5 0.01 1  -2.5 0.01 1  -2.5 0.01 -3  -6.5 0.01 -3
uvs 0 1  1 1  1 0  0 0
triangles 0 1 2  0 2 3
mesh_normal_map domes 1

mesh 0.8 0.75 0.7
vertices -2 0.01 1  2 0.01 1  2 0.01 -3  -2 0.01 -3
uvs 1 1  0 1  0 0  1 0
triangles 0 1 2  0 2 3
mesh_normal_map domes 1

mesh 0.8 0.75 0.7
vertices 2.5 0.01 1  6.5 0.01 1  6.5 0.01 -3  2.5 0.01 -3
uvs 0 1  1 1  1 0  0 0
triangles 0 1 2  0 2 3
mesh_normal_map domes 0

mesh 0.7 0.72 0.8
vertices -1.5 0 -4.5  1.5 0 -4.5  1.5 3 -4.5  -1.5 3 -4.5
vertices 1.5 0 -7.5  -1.5 0 -7.5  -1.5 3 -7.5  1.5 3 -7.5
vertices 1.5 0 -4.5  1.5 0 -7.5  1.5 3 -7.5  1.5 3 -4.5
vertices -1.5 0 -7.5  -1.5 0 -4.5  -1.5 3 -4.5  -1.5 3 -7.5
vertices -1.5 3 -4.5  1.5 3 -4.5  1.5 3 -7.5  -1.5 3 -7.5
vertices -1.5 0 -7.5  1.5 0 -7.5  1.5 0 -4.5  -1.5 0 -4.5
uvs 0 2  2 2  2 0  0 0
uvs 0 2  2 2  2 0  0 0
uvs 0 2  2 2  2 0  0 0
uvs 0 2  2 2  2 0  0 0
uvs 0 0  0 0  0 0  0 0
uvs 0 0  0 0  0 0  0 0
triangles 0 1 2  0 2 3  4 5 6  4 6 7  8 9 10  8 10 11  12 13 14  12 14 15  16 17 18  16 18 19  20 21 22  20 22 23
mesh_normal_map domes 1
mesh_transform 0 0 0  0 1 0  0 30 1
